description	"Dezanti Zhug

A tough Gang leader with a heavy makeshift arsenal.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
- Zhug Rapid Blaster Pistol (1)
-- 15%- Damage/67%+ RoF
- Zhug Heavy Repeater 
-- E-22 (3)
-- 10% More Damage, 25%+ RoF
-- Mag Reload, Cripple on Hit
-- 15% Slower Movement
- Handcrafted Battle Axe
-- Red/Purple Saber
-- Stuns/Cripples
-- Saber/Blaster Defense/Deflect (0)
- Makeshift Flame Grenades (2)
- Frag Nade, Inflict Flame, 10% More Damage

^8Attributes:
- Enforcer Strength (2)
- Rally
- Beskar Chest Plate (1)
- Blast Armor
- Focused (Anti-Mind Trick 1)

^8Powers:
- Duros Rage (Dark Rage 3)

^8Abilities:
- Repair Armor (Armor Dispenser 1) ^3[USE in Melee]
- Shoulder Barge ^3[CS1]
- Grapple Hook ^3[CS4]
- Combat Stim Injection ^3[CS3]
- Verpine Combat Shield ^3[CS4]"
